R("tp31 ai5","會員等級：Bronze(免費)→Silver(10,000 資格哩程或 12 航段)→Gold(20,000 或 24 航段)→Black/Diamond(40,000 或 48 航段)。資格以每年 1/1–12/31 實際搭乘 KGM 航班計算（購買、受讓的里程不列入），只升不降。","會員等級看會籍積分：Bronze(免費)→Silver(240 分，其中 KGM 自營航班 120 分)→Gold(480／240)→Black/Diamond(960／480)。每年 1/1–12/31 累計；每航段＝距離基數 10～60 分 × 艙等票價比率，KGM Cards Star G／M 簽帳也送。哩程與航段數不再作為門檻；2027 年底前只升不降（KGM-FFP-011 Rev. D）。",1);
R("tp31 ai6","Tiers: Bronze (free) → Silver (10,000 qualifying miles or 12 sectors) → Gold (20,000 or 24) → Black/Diamond (40,000 or 48). Counted per calendar year on KGM flights actually flown; purchased or transferred miles do not qualify. Never downgrades.","Tiers run on tier points: Bronze (free) → Silver (240, of which 120 on KGM-operated flights) → Gold (480/240) → Black/Diamond (960/480), per calendar year. Each segment earns a distance base of 10–60 × the cabin/fare rate; KGM Cards Star G/M spend also earns. Miles and sectors no longer qualify; no downgrades until the end of 2027 (KGM-FFP-011 Rev. D).",1);
